 <h3><u>Majura ya zehra</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya ali, ya fatima zahra..(2)<br> Haider ali, ya zahra..(3)</p> 
  <p>Mai chahta hu ke ashoor karbala me karu..(2)<br> ho mere saath saath ehle aza..(2)<br> har ek shaheed ke marqad pe jaake nauha padhu..(2)<br> jo ek wada meri rooh se liya rabne<br> use wafa to karu..(2)<br> Paye ziyarat e mazloom-e-karbala jau<br> karu husain ke marqad pe khoob sina zani..(2)<br> aur uske baad feza me karu buland sadaa...<br> Husain Husaina..(2)<br> Azamallaho lakal ajra alayh bil musiba ya zehra ya ali<br> katle mawlana hussain ibne ali<br> ya aliyun ya aliyun ya ali</p> 
  <p>majurah ya zahra majurah ya zahra<br> maju ya haider ali</p> 
  <p>ya ali x 3</p> 
  <p>1. Haaye,<br> Baat jab alame arwaah me karbal ki chali<br> Pesh Allah bapa majlis e shabbir hui<br> kaun zehra ka azadar hai ye baat khuli..(2)<br> kehne lage ambiya..Majurah ya zahra<br> ehle falak ne kaha.. Maju ya hussain</p> 
  <p>2. Haaye<br> Aur fir matami halqo me bate ehle aza<br> goonj uthi haaye husaina ki sadao se fiza<br> har azadar ne jab matame zanjeer kiya..(2)<br> zakhmo se aayi sada majurah ya zehra<br> behte lahu ne kaha..Maju ya husain<br> &nbsp;<br> 3. Haaye,<br> Dekh kar chaand moharram ka har ek aankh hai nam<br> aur ghar ghar me sajaya gaya gaazi ka alam<br> farshe majlis pe gaye kaale libaso me jo hum..(2)<br> lab pe yahi thi buka majurah ya zehra<br> ashko ne gir kar kaha maju ya hussain</p> 
  <p>4. Haaye,<br> Marsiya dilne padha ashk jo barsaye husain<br> ho salam aap pe ae fatima ka jaye husain<br> farshe majlis pe jo zakir ne kaha haaye husain..(2)<br> nauha bani ye sada majurah ya zehra<br> zikr hai ashoor kaa.... ya husain ya husain ya husain</p> 
  <p>qotelal husain o be karbala<br> zibehal husain o be karbala</p> 
  <p>5. Are asr ka hangaam tha aur aale payambar<br> halqe shahedee pe chala zulm ka khanjar<br> ret ke teele pe khadi zainab e muztar<br> sue najaf dekh ke kehti thi ye rokar<br> azamallahu lakal ajra alayh<br> bil musiba ya zahra ya ali<br> katle mawlana hussain ibne ali</p> 
  <p>6. Haaye,<br> Hogaye pamaal e sitam laashe bahattar<br> laash rahe dasht me naizo pe gaye sar<br> loot ne sadaat ko phir aaye sitamgar<br> kehne laga shame ghariba ka wo manzar<br> azamallahu lakal ajra alayh<br> bil musiba ya zahra ya ali<br> katle mawlana hussain ibne ali</p> 
  <p>7. Are nikle haram nauha kuna fir se safar par<br> ek rasan bara gale aur khule sar<br> qafela salaar bane aabid e muztar<br> tauq o salasil me gala nauha labo par<br> azamallahu lakal ajra alayh<br> bil musiba ya zahra ya ali<br> katle mawlana hussain ibne ali</p> 
  <p>Chali janibe zindaan juhi zainab e zeeshan..(2)<br> sare dasht uthi mazhar o irfan sada<br> husain husain maula..(2)<br> farzand e zehra tere sabr ko salaam<br> athara baras wala hamshakle payambar tha<br> beenayi gayi sheh ki jab uske laga naiza<br> ye ghum tha qayamat ka<br> gaazi ke kate shane, qasim ke hue tukde<br> do laashe labe darya, the auno mohammad ke<br> ye ghum tha qayamat ka<br> ek teer laga aakar besheer ke gardan par<br> baad uske sare maqtal, maula pe chala khanjar<br> Ya zahra ya mehdi</p> 
